Package: transit-atlas
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Maintainer: Branden Algozino <branden@softnessasastrength.com>
Description: Southern New England Transit Atlas with Percival companion
 A transit exploration engine for Connecticut, Massachusetts and Rhode
 Island: multi-agency GTFS routing, the mobility bubble, and the Percival
 local companion stack (MCP over stdio/HTTP, LAN and TUI launchers).
 Taking three buses is a feature, not a bug.
